const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"风险包括威胁，也包括已经发生的事件",en:"Risk here includes threats and realized events"},body:{zh:"Caldara与Iacoviello将战争、恐怖活动及国际紧张局势的威胁、发生和升级纳入定义。这里的“风险”并非只指未来不确定性；在用它解释经济变化前，先要明确自己研究的是威胁预期还是实际冲击。",en:"Caldara and Iacoviello include threats, realizations and escalation of wars, terrorism and international tensions. Risk is not restricted to future uncertainty. An application should distinguish anticipation of threats from the consequences of events already occurring."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.A",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.A"}}},{title:{zh:"命中数必须带着分母看",en:"Keep the denominator with the hit count"},body:{zh:"指数以涉及地缘事件的文章占全部刊发文章的比例为基础，而不是简单汇总关键词次数。报纸总发文量变化，会影响同样命中数量的含义。保存命中文章数的同时，必须保留分母、报纸身份和月份。",en:"The index is based on relevant articles as a share of all published articles, not raw keyword totals. Changes in publishing volume alter the meaning of identical hit counts. Preserve the denominator, newspaper identity and month alongside the relevant-article count."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.B",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.B"}}},{title:{zh:"近期与历史序列使用不同报纸范围",en:"Recent and historical series use different coverage"},body:{zh:"文中的近期序列从1985年开始，使用十家英文报纸；从1900年开始的历史序列使用三家报纸。它们在重叠期间相近，不代表原始样本相同。跨期连接时应保留系列身份，避免把覆盖变化误读成风险变化。",en:"The recent series begins in 1985 with ten English-language newspapers; the historical series begins in 1900 with three. Similarity during the overlap does not make the corpora identical. Preserve series identity when interpreting changes across coverage regimes."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.B; §I.D",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.B; §I.D"}}},{title:{zh:"词语组合和距离决定命中含义",en:"Word combinations and proximity define a match"},body:{zh:"查询分成八类，组合主题词与威胁或行动词，多数类别还要求词语相距足够近。排除词帮助剔除电影、体育等误报。只搜索一个“战争”关键词，会改变测量对象；中文应用还需要另行设计词组和人工核对。",en:"Eight categories combine topic terms with threat or act terms, often requiring proximity. Exclusions reduce false positives such as films or sports. A single war keyword changes the measure; a Chinese application requires its own phrase design and manual validation."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.B",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.B"}}},{title:{zh:"频率和分项回答不同问题",en:"Frequency and components answer different questions"},body:{zh:"日频序列能定位短暂事件，月频序列则混合事件强度与持续时间。威胁分项和行动分项进一步拆开不同内容。一次短促尖峰与持续高位不能只用单日最高值比较，也不应把总指数当成纯粹的威胁指标。",en:"Daily values locate short episodes while monthly values combine intensity and persistence. Threat and act components separate different content. A short spike and sustained coverage are not equivalent, and the headline index should not be relabelled as threats alone."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.C; §I.E",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.C; §I.E"}}},{title:{zh:"媒体覆盖是一层测量，不是事件全集",en:"Media coverage is a measurement layer"},body:{zh:"作者指出，一些缓慢展开且事后才被认识的事件可能不被指数充分捕捉。编辑建议保留检索版本、报纸覆盖和发布日期，不把未命中等同于没有风险。关联教程只展示文档版本记录，平台新闻入口不等于这套历史报纸语料。",en:"The paper notes that slowly unfolding events recognized mainly in hindsight may be missed. Editorial application: retain query versions, coverage and publication dates; no match does not mean no risk. The linked ledger demonstrates version records, not possession of this historical newspaper corpus."},reference:{url:"https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/ifdp/files/ifdp1222r1.pdf",label:{zh:"2022年3月IFDP版 · §I.B–I.D",en:"March 2022 IFDP edition · §I.B–I.D"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读使用封面为2022年3月、正文日期为2021年11月的IFDP版本。新闻覆盖既受事件影响，也受媒体关注影响；指数不是冲突概率，历史文本规则不能自动代表当前数据版本。",en:"The IFDP cover is dated March 2022 and the manuscript November 2021. Coverage reflects both events and media attention. The index is not a conflict probability, and historical text rules do not certify current releases."}};export{e as default};
